    "updated_at": "2021-09-03T16:43:04Z",
    "body": "@bakkot to check my understanding, it seems like the correct test would be that name appears _right after_ length, right? So the test262 test is not as fully strict as it could be.\r\n\r\nI think Web IDL, being more imperative than the ES spec, actually gives a full ordering between length/name/prototype that matches the tests written. But in terms of ensuring implementer interest for this particular change, I agree we're probably OK.",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
